{'symbol': 'PM', 'date': '2021-08-27 07:51:00', 'title': 'PHILIP MORRIS INTERNATIONAL PUBLISHES BUSINESS TRANSFORMATION-LINKED FINANCING FRAMEWORK, FURTHER DEMONSTRATING ITS COMMITMENT TO ACCELERATING THE END OF SMOKING', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--REGULATORY NEWS: PHILIP MORRIS INTERNATIONAL INC. (PMI) (NYSE: PM) TODAY PUBLISHED ITS BUSINESS TRANSFORMATION-LINKED FINANCING FRAMEWORK (“FRAMEWORK”), WHICH INTEGRATES THE COMPANY'S SMOKE-FREE TRANSFORMATION INTO ITS FINANCING STRATEGY. “TO STRENGTHEN OUR COMMITMENT AND FURTHER HIGHLIGHT TO STAKEHOLDERS THE SERIOUSNESS OF OUR SMOKE-FREE AMBITIONS, WE WISH TO LINK OUR MOST MATERIAL SUSTAINABILITY PRIORITIES TO OUR FINANCING,” SAID EMMANUEL BABEAU, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFF"}